{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>And I, here I am bringing.</b> I am ready to agree with those who pressed Me and said before Me, כְּבָר מָה אֱנוֹשׁ כִּי תִזְכְּרֶנּוּ (Psalms 8)." "<b>Flood.</b> That destroyed everything, that confounded everything, that led everything from high to low. And this is the language of Onkelos, who translated טוֹפָנָא — that flooded everything, and brought it to Babylon, which is deep. Therefore it is called Shinar, for there were carried (נִנְעֲרוּ) all the dead of the Flood."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:57:48.393084754Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}